Based on the search results, the 'GS Line' trim was a valid trim level for the most recent Vauxhall Astra (L generation, 2021-present). It was positioned as a sporty-looking mid-range trim. I will evaluate based on the common 1.2 Turbo 130PS petrol engine with the 8-speed automatic transmission, as this is a representative configuration for this trim.

Here is the evaluation based on the gathered data for the Vauxhall Astra L GS Line 1.2 Turbo 130PS Auto and the scoring guide:

